      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, very atmospheric. to really nail the tension, i want to focus on the people in the neighborhood. when the protagonist walks down the street, what kind of characters are they seeing hanging out on the corners or loitering in the shadows? i want to describe the types of people that would make someone feel like they're in a high-crime area and shouldn't stay too long.",
