      "content": "that's a solid vibe. i like the tension with the uncles and the hooded guys. to make the scene feel more grounded and authentic to this specific kind of place, can you flesh out the demographics a bit more? like, when describing the groups hanging out or the people running things in the shadows, what does the racial makeup of the crowd look like to make it feel like a 'realistic' inner-city setting?",
